{"type": "sena", "_data": [{"contents": [{"type": "lesson_name", "content": "Sally's Health and Lifestyle Column"}, {"type": "unit_name", "content": "Curing Pain With Acupuncture"}, {"type": "position", "content": 2}, {"type": "origin", "content": "stub"}, {"type": "lesson", "content": 2}, {"type": "level", "content": "B1.2"}], "type": "metadata"}, {"contents": [{"type": "test", "content": "false"}], "type": "achievment_test"}, {"contents": [{"type": "primary", "content": "Identify and describe events in the news in a range of social and work contexts."}, {"type": "secondary_1", "content": "Discusses a range of options for potential actions at work through the correct use of grammar, vocabulary; level of formality and purpose, and cohesion and coherence aspects appropriate to this level."}, {"type": "secondary_2", "content": "Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about common technology."}, {"type": "secondary_3", "content": "Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about common technology."}, {"type": "secondary_4", "content": "Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about common technology."}, {"type": "secondary_5", "content": "Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about common technology."}, {"type": "secondary_6", "content": "Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about common technology."}, {"type": "secondary_7", "content": "Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about common technology."}, {"type": "secondary_8", "content": "Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about common technology."}], "type": "objectives"}, {"contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": "Modals for Advice"}, {"type": "describer", "content": "To give advice about things like health issues, you can use modals like <span class =\"italic\">might, may, could,</span> or <span class =\"italic\">should</span>."}, {"type": "text", "content": "These modals can go at the beginning of the sentence, or after a clause starting with \u201c<span class =\"italic\">If ... </span>\u201d."}, {"type": "text", "content": "The modal is followed by a verb in the base form. You do not use \u201cto\u201d."}, {"type": "text", "content": "These are formal ways of making suggestions."}, {"type": "example", "content": "You may try visiting an acupuncturist as an alternative to traditional medicine."}, {"type": "example", "content": "If you have a sinus infection, you might want to try acupuncture as well."}, {"type": "example", "content": "You could schedule an appointment with a natural healer and see what she has to say. "}, {"type": "example", "content": "I think you should try a variety of options and see which ones works best for you. "}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": "Conditional Sentences"}, {"type": "describer", "content": "You use the conditional sentences with If clauses to talk about real possibilities in the future."}, {"type": "text", "content": "You use the First Conditional to say it's possible that you will do something. In that condition, something else may or will (not) happen."}, {"type": "text", "content": "The parts of the sentence are divided into two clauses: the <span class =\"italic\">If</span> clause and the <span class =\"italic\">result</span>, or main,  clause."}, {"type": "text", "content": "The If clause can go at the start or the end of the sentence. <br/>When the If clause starts a sentence, you separate the two clauses with a comma. When the main clause starts the sentence, you do not use a comma."}, {"type": "table", "content": "{\"rows\":3,\"columns\":3,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">1st Clause</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">2nd Clause</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">Meaning</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"If you go to only one acupuncture session, \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"you may still feel pain.  \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"It's possible you go to only one acupuncture session. In this condition: you may still feel the pain.\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"You might want to try acupuncture as well\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"if you have a sinus infection. \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"It's possible you have a sinus infection. In this condition: might want to try acupuncture.\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border\"}"}, {"type": "example", "content": "If you go to only one acupuncture session, you may still feel pain."}, {"type": "example", "content": "You might want to try acupuncture as well if you have a sinus infection. "}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "needle"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "instrument used to piece through something, like material or skin"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: How would you like to have hundreds of tiny needles put into different points on your body?"}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn7le02ob02aud01"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "These are words you use when you talk about health procedures."}], "type": "target_word_describer"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "acupuncture"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "traditional Chinese practice of placing needles in the body to relieve pain"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: In the traditional Chinese form of medicine called acupuncture, this is exactly what is done."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn7le02ob02aud02"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "advantage"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "positive aspect"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: The advantage of acupuncture is that it does not have the side effects that some drugs have."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn7le02ob02aud03"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "painkiller"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "drug used to stop people from feeling pain"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Painkillers may be associated with side effects."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn7le02ob02aud04"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "treatment"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "actions completed to cure a patient of a sickness"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Acupuncture has become a popular treatment for pain in Western societies."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn7le02ob02aud05"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "sinuses"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "passages in the head that connect the nasal cavities"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: If you have a sinus infection, you might want to try acupuncture ."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn7le02ob02aud06"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "to cure"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to solve a health problem"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(verb)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Needles in the ear are used to end bad smoking habits and cure addictions."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn7le02ob02aud07"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "to relieve"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to reduce"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(verb)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Acupuncture relieves pain but does not have the side effects of some painkillers."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn7le02ob02aud08"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"type": "background_image", "content": "engenn7le02ob02re1img01.jpg"}, {"contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "With a partner, make a list of 5 questions you would like to answer about acupuncture. For example, you could ask: Does acupuncture work? Where do they put the needles? Etc."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Go online to find the answers to your questions."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Write a paragraph with the information you learned about acupuncture. Remember to include an introduction and a concluding sentence. Try to use conditional (<span class=\"italic\">If</span>) sentences."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Read your paragraph."}], "type": "takeaway_extension"}, {"contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "I write questions about staying healthy using acupuncture."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I find the answers to the questions online."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I write a paragraph of 80 - 100 words giving health advice."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I write conditional sentences."}], "type": "takeaway_assessment"}], "labs": [{"exercises": [{"questions": [], "img_path": "", "stimuli_ids": [0], "template_override": 1, "type": "WLC", "_data": [{"contents": [{"type": "Learning Outcomes", "content": " I can talk about staying healthy."}, {"type": "Learning Outcomes", "content": "I can discuss how to d