ed \"chi.\" This flow of energy affects how the body reacts to pain.<br/>\nThe advantage of acupuncture to relieve pain is that it does not have the side effects that painkillers have. However, if you go to only one acupuncture session, you may still feel pain. If you want to be completely cured, you may have to go to an acupuncture therapist many times.", "time": "14500", "id": 2, "image": "engenn7le02ob02re2img01.jpg"}, {"text": "You might want to try acupuncture as well if you have a sinus infection.  In addition, acupuncture has helped in curing people of addictions. Needles in the ear are used to end bad smoking habits and cure addictions.", "time": "54000", "id": 3, "image": "engenn7le02ob02re2img01.jpg"}], "audiosrc": "engenn7le02ob02re2aud01", "coverimg": "engenn7le02ob02re2img01.jpg"}}], "template_override": 1, "type": "audio", "_data": [], "id": 1, "title": ""}, {"contents": [{"type": "video", "value": {"images": [{"text": "How would you like to have hundreds of tiny needles put into different points on your body to cure you of your aches and pains? In the traditional Chinese form of medicine called acupuncture, this is exactly what is done.", "time": "0", "id": 0, "image": ""}, {"text": "In recent years, acupuncture has become a popular treatment for pain in Western societies. In acupuncture, needles are inserted into special points on the body. The needles help control the flow of the body's energy, called \"chi.\" This flow of energy affects how the body reacts to pain.<br/>\nThe advantage of acupuncture to relieve pain is that it does not have the side effects that painkillers have. However, if you go to only one acupuncture session, you may still feel pain. If you want to be completely cured, you may have to go to an acupuncture therapist many times.", "time": "14000", "id": 1, "image": ""}, {"text": "You may want to try acupuncture as well if you have a sinus infection.  In addition, acupuncture has helped in curing people of addictions. Needles in the ear are also used to end bad smoking habits and cure addictions.", "time": "51500", "id": 2, "image": ""}], "video_src": "engenn7le02ob02re2vid01"}}], "template_override": 1, "type": "video", "_data": [], "id": 2, "title": ""}], "_data": [{"contents": [{"type": "has_nav", "content": true}, {"type": "has_exercise_controls", "content": true}], "type": "lab_options"}]}]}